击“RESTORE MESSAGES”并访问非Microsoft站点。微软称活动很可能是凭据钓鱼，但现有证据未确认凭据被窃取、恶意软件投递、账户失陷或后续攻击，也未发现失陷指标。\n\n已分析样本均为链接型，未发现二维码、非EML附件或可执行文件、压缩包、文档等恶意载荷；受Microsoft Defender for Office保护的环境目前会拦截或隔离这些邮件。微软尚未将该活动归因于具名威胁组织或恶意软件家族。","Microsoft 365 全球中断期间出现高量级协同钓鱼活动",{"_105":342,"_107":343,"_109":-5,"_110":-5},"/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwechat2rss.xlab.app%2Fimg-proxy%2F%3Fk%3Ddd6e1ba0%26amp%3Bu%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%252Fmmbiz_jpg%252FodcL3w4qOqicKu1NBj6EmrmJ2L1vtdibIf2SlEgOGyrehoneSHCvJKtW92tQmrOkXE0ufIjq47tSOgzuXjmey5Rvh0L6uqv84dgowicNymFg9k%252F0%253Fwx_fmt%253Djpeg&mode=full&exp=1795219200&sig=d61e2e3a07b33575","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwechat2rss.xlab.app%2Fimg-proxy%2F%3Fk%3Ddd6e1ba0%26amp%3Bu%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%252Fmmbiz_jpg%252FodcL3w4qOqicKu1NBj6EmrmJ2L1vtdibIf2SlEgOGyrehoneSHCvJKtW92tQmrOkXE0ufIjq47tSOgzuXjmey5Rvh0L6uqv84dgowicNymFg9k%252F0%253Fwx_fmt%253Djpeg&mode=thumb&exp=1795219200&sig=ed50e477ed3a0a72 720w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwechat2rss.xlab.app%2Fimg-proxy%2F%3Fk%3Ddd6e1ba0%26amp%3Bu%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%252Fmmbiz_jpg%252FodcL3w4qOqicKu1NBj6EmrmJ2L1vtdibIf2SlEgOGyrehoneSHCvJKtW92tQmrOkXE0ufIjq47tSOgzuXjmey5Rvh0L6uqv84dgowicNymFg9k%252F0%253Fwx_fmt%253Djpeg&mode=image-1200&exp=1795219200&sig=932e7fc177bc5bef 1200w, /api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwechat2rss.xlab.app%2Fimg-proxy%2F%3Fk%3Ddd6e1ba0%26amp%3Bu%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%252Fmmbiz_jpg%252FodcL3w4qOqicKu1NBj6EmrmJ2L1vtdibIf2SlEgOGyrehoneSHCvJKtW92tQmrOkXE0ufIjq47tSOgzuXjmey5Rvh0L6uqv84dgowicNymFg9k%252F0%253Fwx_fmt%253Djpeg&mode=full&exp=1795219200&sig=d61e2e3a07b33575 1600w",8.9,8.4,7.5,16.9,25,34,33.1,32.1,31.2,30.3,29.5,28.6,27.8,27,26.3,25.5,{"_80":196,"_82":83,"_84":-5},{"_80":365,"_82":83,"_84":-5},{"_80":267,"_82":83,"_84":268,"_87":269},{"_80":364,"_82":83,"_84":-5},"Cybernews","Microsoft Security Blog","caeb8d6f-1cd3-4db4-b8ed-a5f3f3c16c9a","攻击者借Microsoft 365故障实施钓鱼",1,{"_90":410,"_92":411},60.5,"flat",-1.3,[],[407,267,127,404,85,223,364,130],[395,396,397,398,399,400,401,402,403],[-5,-5,-5,382,304,305,94,306,147,149,150,151,383,384,385,386,387,388,389,370,390,391,392,393,394],"Optimizely确认，未经授权方利用Experimentation漏洞，在客户账户的custom Project JavaScript字段注入恶意JavaScript，经厂商合法CDN和证书向访客分发，涉及至少178家组织；厂商已修补漏洞、移除注入代码并加固受影响账户。Report URI检查1,611个脚本，发现188个受感染，涉CNN、BBC、Salesforce、Zoom、GitLab、HSBC、Equifax和IKEA，并称所有感染文件已于11月16日23:11 UTC清除，实际范围可能更大。\n\nUnit 42将攻击命名为OPTIMJACK，称载荷可替换加密钱包地址、收集结账表单中的支付卡信息，并向iPhone和iPad投递Coruna（针对iOS 13.0至17.2.1）和DarkSword（针对iOS 18.4至18.7）；跨源支付iframe中的卡号无法读取，Unit 42建议将暴露的支付数据视为可能已泄露。尚无证据表明机构内网被攻破、所有访客设备均遭入侵或真实iPhone已被攻陷，成功入侵设备及被盗支付记录数量仍未知，攻击者最…","OPTIMJACK 利用 Optimizely 漏洞向至少 178 家组织网站注入恶意 JavaScript",{"_105":380,"_107":381,"_109":-5,"_110":-5},"/dailyinfo/media/143fc041151ae3ed.jpg","/dailyinfo/media/1480282f1a8d82d6.jpg 720w, /dailyinfo/media/47ccf9dfc4e2dc31.jpg 1200w, /dailyinfo/media/143fc041151ae3ed.jpg 1600w",9.8,44.8,53.2,51.7,68,66,64.1,62.3,58.8,57.2,65.2,63.3,61.5,{"_80":407,"_82":83,"_84":408,"_87":409},{"_80":267,"_82":83,"_84":268,"_87":269},{"_80":127,"_82":83,"_84":128,"_87":129},{"_80":404,"_82":83,"_84":405,"_87":406},{"_80":85,"_82":83,"_84":86,"_87":88},{"_80":223,"_82":83,"_84":224,"_87":225},{"_80":130,"_82":83},{"_80":159,"_82":83},{"_80":364,"_82":83},"Hackread","/dailyinfo/media/dd06beac4cadc6f3.webp","/dailyinfo/media/47417cbef4636b7b.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/dd06beac4cadc6f3.webp 96w","Unit 42","/dailyinfo/media/4d373ddb2d54a219.webp","/dailyinfo/media/c5c35eb93d4d2e80.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/4d373ddb2d54a219.webp 96w","9c6cfeee-afca-48bc-9a37-6ffde4a1dd7e","Optimizely漏洞遭利用，178家机构站点被注入恶意脚本",{"_413":414,"_415":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
